{"id": "r05_01", "text": "Sort the blocks by colour: red ones to the left bin, yellow ones to the middle bin, blue ones to the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_02", "text": "The left bin takes blue, the center bin takes red, and the right bin takes yellow.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_03", "text": "Yellow items belong in the right-hand bin; red items in the left-hand one; blue items go in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_04", "text": "Please place every blue piece into the leftmost bin, every red piece into the rightmost bin and every yellow piece into the central bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_05", "text": "chuck the reds in the left one, yellows in the middle one and blues in the one on the right", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_06", "text": "1) Red objects go in the right bin. 2) Yellow objects go in the left bin. 3) Blue objects go in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_07", "text": "Red and yellow both go into the left bin; blue goes into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_08", "text": "Everything goes in the center bin except the blue objects, which go in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_09", "text": "The middle bin receives all red items. Yellow and blue items are both collected in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_10", "text": "Could you please sort these for me? I'd like the yellow ones in the left bin, the blue ones in the center bin, and the red ones in the right bin. Thanks!", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_11", "text": "Crimson pieces go in the middle bin, golden pieces in the left bin, and navy pieces in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_12", "text": "Put all the objects into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_13", "text": "The left bin is reserved for yellow. Red and blue share the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_14", "text": "Move the blue things to the right bin and the red things to the left bin. Yellow things go to the right bin as well.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_15", "text": "Fill the bins from left to right with red, blue and yellow, one colour per bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_16", "text": "I want the reds in the centre, the blues on the left side and the yellows on the right side.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_17", "text": "Sort by colour into the three bins. Blue: middle. Red: right. Yellow: left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_18", "text": "Every object goes to the left bin, but the yellow ones go to the right bin instead.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_19", "text": "Put the red stuff in the middle bin and the other two colours in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_20", "text": "Red goes to the right bin, and yellow joins it there. Blue goes to the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_21", "text": "I think the simplest way is probably this: the red pieces should end up in the bin on the left, and, if it's not too much trouble, the yellow ones in the one on the right, with the blue ones in the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_22", "text": "Use only the two outer bins: red on the right, blue and yellow on the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_23", "text": "Each colour gets its own bin: blue in the left bin, red in the right bin, yellow in the centre bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_24", "text": "Drop all the yellow items into the middle bin, all the red items into the middle bin too, and all the blue items into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_25", "text": "Target bins by colour - red: left, yellow: left, blue: center.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_26", "text": "Gather the blue objects in the right bin, the red ones in the center bin, and the yellow ones in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_27", "text": "Put the red and blue objects in the right bin, and the yellow objects in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_28", "text": "Sort them like this: yellow things in the bin furthest to the left, blue things in the bin furthest to the right, red things in the one between them.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_29", "text": "Put every red, yellow and blue object in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_30", "text": "Load the right bin with the blue pieces and the middle bin with the yellow pieces; the red pieces go in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_31", "text": "Cubes go in the left bin, cylinders in the middle bin, and triangular prisms in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_32", "text": "Put the cubes in the right bin, the tubes in the left bin, and the wedges in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_33", "text": "Red objects go left, yellow objects go right, and blue objects go in the middle, except the blue cube, which goes left as well.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_34", "text": "Sort by colour: red in the center bin, yellow in the left bin, blue in the right bin. The only exception is the yellow triangle: it goes in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_35", "text": "All the cylinders go to the right bin. Everything else is sorted by colour: red left, yellow center, blue left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_36", "text": "The left bin takes the red cube and the blue cube, the right bin takes all the triangles, and the center bin takes everything else.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_37", "text": "Put the cylinders in the left bin and every other shape in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_38", "text": "Yellow cubes and yellow cylinders to the middle bin, yellow triangles to the left bin, and all red and blue objects to the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_39", "text": "Shapes decide the bin, not colours: prisms in the center bin, cubes in the right bin, cylinders in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_40", "text": "Every blue object goes into the left bin. Of the remaining objects, cubes go into the center bin and everything else into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_41", "text": "Red, yellow and blue cylinders all go in the right bin; red, yellow and blue cubes all go in the left bin; and the triangles go in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_42", "text": "Put the blue triangle in the center bin, the red triangle in the left bin and the yellow triangle in the right bin. All the cubes and cylinders go in the left bin too.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shapes", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_43", "text": "Put the red objects in the left bin and the blue objects in the right bin. Leave the yellow objects on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_44", "text": "Only sort the blue items: they go in the center bin. Don't touch anything else.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_45", "text": "Red to the right bin and yellow to the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_46", "text": "Move all cubes to the left bin and all cylinders to the right bin; the triangles stay where they are.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_47", "text": "Put everything in the center bin except the yellow pieces, which should stay on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_48", "text": "The left bin gets yellow, the right bin gets red. Blue stays on the table.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_49", "text": "Put the red cube, the red cylinder and the red triangle in the right bin, and leave the rest on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_50", "text": "Blue objects go to the left bin and yellow objects go to the left bin as well, but leave the blue triangle on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r05_51", "text": "Normally blue goes left, red goes center and yellow goes right. Today, rotate them: yellow goes where blue would normally go, blue goes where red would normally go, and red goes where yellow would normally go.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_comparison_rotation", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r05_52", "text": "Each colour gets its own bin. Red is not in the left bin or the center bin. Yellow is not in the left bin either.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_elimination", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r05_53", "text": "The bin on the left, which is the one closest to the window, should end up holding nothing but blue pieces, while the yellow and red pieces all go into the bin on the right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_bin_before_colour_long_clause", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r05_54", "text": "Red goes in the bin furthest from the right-hand end, blue in the bin furthest from the left-hand end, and yellow in the remaining bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_furthest_from", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r05_55", "text": "Red does not go in the right bin; it goes in the left bin. Yellow does not go in the left bin; it goes in the right bin. Blue goes in neither the left nor the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_negation_then_correct", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r05_56", "text": "Step 1: put all the objects in the left bin. Step 2: take the yellow ones back out and put them in the right bin. Step 3: take the red cylinder out of the bin and put it back on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_sequential_steps", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r05_57", "text": "The center bin (not the left one, which is for red) is where blue goes; yellow takes the remaining bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_parenthetical_assignment", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r05_58", "text": "Blue goes right. Red goes in the bin next to blue's, and yellow shares a bin with red.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_adjacency_chain", "adversarial": true}
